text = "[b][font_size= 32]Jumpin[/font_size][/b]
[i]Use W, UpArrow, SPACE, or K[/i]

Includes a jump and a double jump.

-Double jump is 1.2x Stronger than the regular jump

-landing on ground grants both jumps back
-dashing grants 1 jump back
-wall grabbing grants 1 jump back
-If dash chaining, any jump gives an extra 0.5 seconds to do a dash chain
"

