text = "[b][font_size= 32]Dash Chargin[/font_size][/b]
[i]Use SHIFT or J.[/i]

Charge up a dash.
-Immune to lightning bolts while charging
- hold for 0.8 seconds > Charged dash (Recommended)
- hold for less and 0.8 seconds > Normal Dash

Landing on the floor - Grants 2 Charges
WallGrabbing - Grants 1 Charge


"

