text = "[b][font_size= 32]Dash Releasin[/font_size][/b]
[i]Release DASH CHARGE button.[/i]

- hold for DASH CHARGE 0.8 seconds > Charged dash (Recommended)
2x stronger than jump
capable to activate dash chaining

- hold DASH CHARGE for less and 0.8 seconds > Normal Dash
1.5x stronger than jump
you usually do this on accident when you fail dash chaining

 Both Dashes grant 1 Jump back.

"

