text = "[b][font_size= 32]Dash Chainin[/font_size][/b]
[i]After a Charged dash, do another dash within 2 seconds to instantly charge another Charged dash.[/i]

-buffs movment speed by x1.05, Caps at 1.5x, Cap increased to 2x at region 3, and is uncapped at region 4.
-Any jump gives an extra 0.5 seconds to do a dash chain
-you probably wont make it past 2000 without doing this constantly
-pray to rng jesus for good platform spawns




"

